::: {.column width="50%"}
$$\frac{\partial T}{\partial x} = 2xy - 2, \qquad \frac{\partial T}{\partial y} = x^2 + 1$$

$$\left.\frac{\partial T}{\partial x}\right|_{(1,3)} = 2(1)(3)-2 = 4 \;{}^\circ\text{C/m}$$

$$\left.\frac{\partial T}{\partial y}\right|_{(0,2)} = (0)^2+1 = 1 \;{}^\circ\text{C/m}$$

:::

